step_id: G-004
name: Model Disk Cache, Memory Lifecycle, and LMCache Storage
description: Define the model disk cache lifecycle, explicit model memory load 
  and unload lifecycle, and vLLM LMCache integration as a cache subsystem. This 
  step separates model files, model residency, LMCache runtime artifacts, CPU 
  and disk cache tiers, and cache telemetry from GPU admission capacity.
